# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## What This Is

A NERC System Operator Certification exam study environment built entirely on Claude Code skills and commands. There is no application code — the project is a structured set of reference files, progress logs, and Claude Code skills that together form an adaptive tutoring system for the Reliability Coordinator (RC) exam.

